flowchart TD
  C[Change Request] --> I[Impact Analysis]
  I --> B[Business Review]
  I --> T[Technical/Data/Security/AI Review]
  B --> D{Change Control Board}
  T --> D
  D -->|Reject| R[Rejected or Deferred]
  D -->|Approve| M[Implement and Migrate]
  M --> V[Verify and Test]
  V --> L[Version, Approve, and Lock]
  L --> A[Audit and Release Record]
